# The songs are floppy files (sound/sound.toml disk = true), loaded one a frame
# in the splash's black start, before the title theme starts: all three are in
# chip RAM when the title comes up, so nothing loads later (a load in play or on
# a card would freeze the picture for seconds and stop the music).
wait-serial "AGK t0" 1000
expect-serial "AGK songs loaded"
expect-serial "AGK music theme"
expect-no-serial "too little chip|ERR|missing"
expect-min-chip-free 96
